      "type": "spo:InformationContentEntity",
      "stage": "S3",
      "stage_order": 3,
      "title": {
        "zh": "S3 新经典输运与自举电流",
        "en": "S3 Neoclassical transport and bootstrap current"
      },
      "question": {
        "zh": "在给定局域态与度规上，新经典系数、自举电流与动理学方程的解，与 NEO 及已发表的拟合是否一致。",
        "en": "On a given local state and metric, do the neoclassical coefficients, the bootstrap current and the drift-kinetic solution agree with NEO and with published fits?"
      },
      "depends_on": [
        "plan/S2-geometry"
      ],
      "why_here": {
        "zh": "新经典消费度规与局域梯度，不消费湍流。它与 S4 是**并列的两支**，不是前后：把它排在湍流之前只因它的参考侧更硬（上游自带答案、解析极限齐全），失败时更容易定位。",
        "en": "Neoclassical consumes metrics and local gradients but not turbulence; it is a sibling of S4, placed first only because its reference side is harder and failures localize more easily."
      },
      "entries": [
